  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3131 describes the functional architecture of fixed mobile convergence in IMT-2020 networks, which supports the requirements of network evolution and accommodates convergent services in fixed and mobile networks. This Recommendation presents the overview, framework and functional architecture for supporting fixed mobile convergence in IMT-2020 networks.</abstract>
